    "within": "Q1 names a rotated right-angled triangle. Q2 recognises a tilted square. Q3 selects right-angled and scalene triangles. Q4 matches differently proportioned flat shapes. Q5 names a rotated cube. Q6 recognises a tall non-cubic cuboid. Q7 selects square-based and triangular-based pyramids. Q8 distinguishes a sphere from a circle. Q9 relates a box to a cuboid. Q10 matches varied solids to names. No hints.",
    "versus": "Easy recognises familiar flat shapes and solids, with hints on the first three. Medium varies size, orientation and proportions, including right-angled and scalene triangles and triangular-based pyramids. Hard mixes flat and solid shapes, recognises squares as rectangles and cubes as cuboids, and ignores colour and size. No spelling, face-counting or turn calculations."
